  "title": "J & J SNACK FOODS SCHEDULES FISCAL 2026 FIRST QUARTER EARNINGS CONFERENCE CALL AND WEBCAST",
  "summary": "MOUNT LAUREL, N.J. , Jan. 16, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J & J Snack Foods Corp. (Nasdaq: JJSF) today announced that it will release financial results for its fiscal first quarter ended December 27, 2025 , before the stock market opens on Tuesday, February 3, 2026 .",
